PASS while the first reply is held: fresh read records the Host state; no reconciliation action; Save held; newer typing kept
PASS repeated Save during the wait: still exactly one PUT
PASS the delayed 200 settles as saved; its own revision's reading is cleared; newer typing remains unsaved
PASS a deliberate second Save after settlement: one more PUT at the next revision; saved hash equals the newer text
JOURNEY R2 OK
exit 0
